   "text": "Maisy wagged her tail when she saw Dr. Grant. \"What's the matter?\" Dr. Grant asked. \"Maisy won't eat,\" said Dana. \"And you know Maisy. She loves to eat!\" Dr. Grant checked Maisy. \"Maisy has gained three pounds,\" said the doctor. \"She must be eating something!\"",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
